<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia wage ruling boosts outlook-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia wage ruling boosts outlook-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Friday that the transport workers wage decision, delivered by the Australian Industrial Relations Commission on Thursday, had improved the outlook for wages growth.</p>
<p>&quot;If we hadn't have had the decision that we had yesterday the prospects wouldn't have been as good,&quot; Costello told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a good decision yesterday.&quot;</p>
</text>
